B.anI=s(["Fill a hot water bottle with warm (not boiling) water and wrap it in a towel.","Rest it on your lower belly or lower back for about 15 minutes.","Lie on your side with your knees gently bent if that feels better.","A warm shower can bring the same relief when you are out of energy."],t.s)
