B.axo=new A.ak("Orders & delivery",B.am0)
B.axp=new A.ak("Who can read my messages?","Chats with friends are end-to-end encrypted: only you and the other person can read them, not PIAX. Calls go directly between the two phones and are encrypted too. Chats with the AI health assistant are not end-to-end encrypted, because the assistant has to read them to reply.")
B.axY=new A.ak("How do I start a chat with a friend?","Go to Chats \u2192 New message. Share your invite QR code or link, scan a friend's code, or verify your phone number to see which of your contacts use PIAX.")
B.axH=new A.ak("Why can't I call someone?",'Calls ring only while the other person has PIAX open. If they are offline you will see "Unavailable" and the missed call appears in your chat.')
