B.ay7=new A.ak("Chats & calls",B.ael)
B.axA=new A.ak("Is my cycle data private?","Yes. Turn on Discreet mode in Profile \u2192 Privacy & your data to hide sensitive details on screen. From the same page you can copy or delete your data at any time.")
B.axF=new A.ak("What happens if I reinstall the app?","Your account is tied to this install. Reinstalling creates a new account, and encrypted chats from the old install can't be opened on the new one.")
B.ahk=s([B.axA,B.axF],t.Wy)
B.axk=new A.ak("Your data & privacy",B.ahk)
B.axB=new A.ak("Why am I not getting reminders?","Check Profile \u2192 Reminders, and make sure notifications for PIAX are allowed in your phone's settings.")
B.axD=new A.ak("How do subscriptions work?","See Profile \u2192 Subscribe for the current plans, including Saver's Six, and what each one includes and costs.")
